I'm hoping the development team, at their convenience will make a small
correction to http://www.bluez.org/development/lists/ :  The current
reference to 'How to Ask Questions the Smart Way' mentions my co-author 
Eric S. Raymond, but omits the other co-author (me).  

It's an easy error to make, because the better known of our copies on
the Web is Eric's, at http://www.catb.org/~esr/faqs/smart-questions.html .
Anyway, Eric and I joined forces on writing the essay in 2000, and went
public with it starting in 2001.  You can see for yourself that both our
names are shown up-top as authors.

Thanks.

